#showas:难度 5 - 双 AI
Not a complex scenario at all.  It's just you and two AIs, and both are set to difficulty 5.  This is a bit harder than the first scenario, and is good if you've comfortably beaten that one already, or already have some RTS experience going in. The AI is still a bit limited, though.

This is on the "realistic" map type, with 80 planets.  Simple Ensemble AI type in both cases.  Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.

Two AIs are slightly harder to fight than one, in that you have two Overlords to find and destroy.